# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
# Ignore compiled binaries and shared libraries
# start of binary files section
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
chat.exe
# end of binary files section
# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
# start of test binaries section
*.test
# end of test binaries section
# Environment files
# start of environment files section
.env
data/
data/sqlite.*
data/sqlite3.*
data/chat.db
data/chat.db-shm
data/chat.db-wal
data/chat.db-journal
data/chat.db.lock
data/chat.db-tmp


# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum
auth_test.go

# Environment files
.env
.testenv    
# end of environment files section
.testenv
# Editor/IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
# End of file